    {
      "i": 12,
      "speaker": "USHINI",
      "tc": true,
      "caption": "It's all under a Creative Commons licence at llmsunplugged.org. Every section of every lesson has its own short video, so you can play them in class. Grab the resources, run the activities, and if you'd like us to deliver it in person, get in touch.",
